Height":1020},"428x856","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/428/856/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",428,285,{"Name":1022,"Url":1023,"Width":1024,"Height":1025},"592x1184","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/592/1184/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",592,395,{"Name":1027,"Url":1028,"Width":1029,"Height":1030},"960x1920","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/960/1920/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",960,640,{"Name":1032,"Url":1033,"Width":843,"Height":1034},"1280x2560","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1280/2560/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",800,"https://eupravozato.mondo.rs/energetika-i-zivotna-sredina/energetska-efikasnost/a21186/koliko-ce-nas-kostati-grejanje-ove-zime-izasla-racunica-za-stan-od-60-kvadrata.html",[1037],{"Text":879,"Type":873,"Name":880},21206,"ArticleBigImage","B",[1042,1043,1044],"Agencija za energetiku Srbije izračunala je troškove grejanja za stan od 60 kvadrata u kome živi četvoročlana porodica.","Najjeftiniji su gas i drva, oko 60.000 dinara po sezoni, dok pelet košta oko 114.000, a direktno grejanje na struju može da dostigne 250.000 dinara.","Stručnjaci savetuju kupovinu efikasnijih uređaja i bolju izolaciju, jer to može znatno da smanji račun za grejanje.",{"DocumentId":1046,"Title":1047,"ShortDescription":1048,"RootMenuItemId":976,"RootMenuItemName":977,"ParentMenuItemId":1049,"ParentMenuItemName":1050,"LastEditDate":1051,"PublishedDate":1051,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":1052,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":982,"PosterPhoto":1053,"WebUrl":1080,"DocumentAttributes":1081,"MasterDocumentId":1083,"DocumentTypeAlias":1039,"CardType":1040,"ContentSummary":1084},21183,"Da li vrelo leto znači da ćemo imati i ledenu zimu? Posle El Ninja, sad se pominje i polarni vrtlog","Ovaj vremenski fenomen će dostići vrhunac tek krajem jeseni ili početkom zime.",42,"Klimatske promene","10/09/2026 10:20:51","09.10.2026. / 10:20",{"ImageId":1054,"Description":11,"CopyRight":985,"ImageUrl":1055,"ThumbnailUrl":1056,"MediumImageUrl":1057,"AltText":1058,"Variations":1059},19064,"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064/thumbnail?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064/medium?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","žene se probijaju kroz mećavu i sneg",[1060,1062,1064,1066,1068,1070,1072,1074,1076,1078],{"Name":34,"Url":1061,"Width":36,"Height":37},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":994,"Url":1063,"Width":996,"Height":253},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/194/388/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":998,"Url":1065,"Width":1000,"Height":1001},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/212/424/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1003,"Url":1067,"Width":1005,"Height":1006},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/288/576/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1008,"Url":1069,"Width":174,"Height":1010},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/324/648/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1012,"Url":1071,"Width":1014,"Height":1015},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/396/792/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1017,"Url":1073,"Width":1019,"Height":1020},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/428/856/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1022,"Url":1075,"Width":1024,"Height":1025},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/592/1184/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1027,"Url":1077,"Width":1029,"Height":1030},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/960/1920/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1032,"Url":1079,"Width":843,"Height":1034},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1280/2560/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://eupravozato.mondo.rs/energetika-i-zivotna-sredina/klimatske-promene/a21183/el-ninjo-i-polarni-vrtlog-da-li-vrelo-leto-znaci-da-cemo-imati-i-ledenu-zimu.html",[1082],{"Text":879,"Type":873,"Name":880},21203,[1085,1086,1087],"El Ninjo bi mogao da bude najjači do sada i da poveća šanse da 2027. bude najtoplija godina otkako se mere temperature, uz više ekstremnih vrućina i vremenskih nepogoda.","U Evropi su posledice uglavnom indirektne, ali bi kasnije ove godine mogla da uslede blaža, kišovitija i vetrovitija jesen i početak zime.","Kada El Ninjo oslabi polarni vrtlog, raste rizik od iznenadnog stratosferskog zagrevanja, koje može da donese hladnije vreme u severnoj Evropi.",{"DocumentId":1089,"Title":1090,"ShortDescription":1091,"RootMenuItemId":976,"RootMenuItemName":977,"ParentMenuItemId":978,"ParentMenuItemName":979,"LastEditDate":1092,"PublishedDate":1092,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":1093,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":1094,"PosterPhoto":1095,"WebUrl":1130,"DocumentAttributes":1131,"MasterDocumentId":1089,"DocumentTypeAlias":1039,"CardType":1040},4040,"Šta sve obavezno treba da uradimo pred zimu kako bi nam bilo toplo? \"Ko u ovo uloži, uštedeo je najviše\"","Hladno vreme je stiglo i u naše krajeve, ali se treba potruditi da hladnoća ne prodire i u naše...","11/11/2025 08:57:00","11.11.2025. / 08:57","11.11.2025.",{"ImageId":1096,"Description":1097,"CopyRight":1098,"ImageUrl":1099,"ThumbnailUrl":1100,"MediumImageUrl":1101,"AltText":1102,"Variations":1103},4438,"Kako dolazi zima treba da se postaramo da prodor hladnog vazduha u naše prostorije treba da bude na minimumu","Jochen Tack / Alamy / Alamy / Profimedia","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438/thumbnail?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438/medium?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","Devojka leži na kauču pokrivena ćebetom dok joj se noge greju na radijatoru",[1104,1106,1109,1112,1114,1117,1119,1122,1125,1128],{"Name":34,"Url":1105,"Width":36,"Height":652},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/4438?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59",{"Name":994,"Url":1107,"Width":996,"Hei