 šta se menja","Nemačka od 2027. planira da prepolovi godišnju kvotu radnih dozvola za radnike sa Zapadnog Balkana, dok analitičar...",631,"Info",642,"Ekonomija","10/09/2026 17:28:52","09.10.2026. / 17:28",{"ImageId":1705,"Description":11,"CopyRight":1706,"ImageUrl":1707,"ThumbnailUrl":1708,"MediumImageUrl":1709,"AltText":1710,"Variations":1711},1440884,"Marcin Balcerzak/Shutterstock","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1440884/thumbnail?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1440884/medium?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59","shutterstock_44771329 copy.jpg",[1712,1714,1717,1720,1723,1726,1729,1732,1734,1737],{"Name":34,"Url":1713,"Width":36,"Height":354},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",{"Name":994,"Url":1715,"Width":996,"Height":1716},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/194/388/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",109,{"Name":998,"Url":1718,"Width":1000,"Height":1719},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/212/424/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",119,{"Name":1003,"Url":1721,"Width":1005,"Height":1722},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/288/576/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",162,{"Name":1008,"Url":1724,"Width":174,"Height":1725},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/324/648/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",182,{"Name":1012,"Url":1727,"Width":1014,"Height":1728},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/396/792/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",223,{"Name":1017,"Url":1730,"Width":1019,"Height":1731},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/428/856/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",241,{"Name":1022,"Url":1733,"Width":1024,"Height":142},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/592/1184/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",{"Name":1027,"Url":1735,"Width":1029,"Height":1736},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/960/1920/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",540,{"Name":1032,"Url":1738,"Width":843,"Height":1739},"https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1280/2560/1440884?ts=2024-10-18T14:07:59",675,"https://mondo.rs/Info/Ekonomija/a2294040/nemacka-povlaci-potez-koji-ce-pogoditi-i-radnike-iz-srbije.html",{"happy":293},[1743],{"Text":879,"Type":873,"Name":880},1179583,[1746,1747,1748],"Nemačka od 2027. planira da prepolovi kvotu radnih dozvola za radnike sa Zapadnog Balkana na 25.000, što je izazvalo nezadovoljstvo poslodavaca i zabrinutost zbog posledica po privredu.","Ekonomski analitičar Dominik Raškaj ocenjuje da bi mera dugoročno mogla da bude prilika za region da zadrži i vrati deo radne snage, uz bolje plate i programe povratka.","On upozorava da zemlje regiona ne bi trebalo da se oslanjaju samo na uvoz radnika, već da razviju politike za zadržavanje domaće radne snage i zajednički nastup prema EU.",{"DocumentId":1750,"Title":1751,"ShortDescription":1752,"RootMenuItemId":1698,"RootMenuItemName":1699,"ParentMenuItemId":1700,"ParentMenuItemName":1701,"LastEditDate":1753,"PublishedDate":1753,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":1754,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":982,"PosterPhoto":1755,"WebUrl":1783,"HasVideo":23,"HasPhotoGallery":23,"DocumentAttributes":1784,"MasterDocumentId":1786,"DocumentTypeAlias":1039,"CardType":1040},2294015,"Ove greške vam drastično povećavaju račune: Pratite ove korake za jeftinije grejanje","Stručnjaci upozoravaju na šest grešaka sa kotlom i radijatorima koji povećavaju račune.","10/09/2026 17:12:19","09.10.2026. / 17:12",{"ImageId":1756,"Description":11,"CopyRight":1757,"ImageUrl":1758,"ThumbnailUrl":1759,"MediumImageUrl":1760,"AltText":1761,"Variations":1762},1726761,"Shutterstock/Olga Dzhoshkuner/rafa jodar/MONDO/Uroš Arsić/Stefan Stojanović","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1726761?ts=2026-09-25T09:26:02","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1726761/thumbnail?ts=2026-09-25T09:26:02","https://static2.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1726761/medium?ts=2026-09-25T09:26:02","Artboard 1.png",[1763,1765,1767,1769,1771,1773,1775,1777,1779,1781],{"Name":34,"Url":1764,"Width":36,"Height":354},"htt